ate_et":"2025-02-18","when_et":"Feb 18, 2025, 1:54 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1891924212794691888","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5194,"like_count":9,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":88,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890904332498825723","text":"Thx to the thousands of folks from across #WA02 who tuned in to my telephone town hall this afternoon!\n\nI was able to get to 18 of your questions, but if you have a question that didn\u2019t get answered, contact my office at Rick.Larsen@mail.house.gov or at https://t.co/1IH7WJ84vg. https://t.co/v7uBIoN5La https://t.co/wdlLt72RfG","created_at":"2025-02-15T23:21:38.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-15","when_et":"Feb 15, 2025, 6:21 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890904332498825723","metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":49883,"like_count":16,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":62,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":true,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890877811369320466","text":"Thank you to everyone who has asked a question during my telephone town hall so far!\n\n\ud83d\udcde 855-962-0954\n\ud83d\udcbb https://t.co/a5qbfQ0vGI https://t.co/oLw3gytLpU","created_at":"2025-02-15T21:36:15.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-15","when_et":"Feb 15, 2025, 4:36 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890877811369320466","metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2307,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":3},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890813108714647931","text":"Join me for a telephone town hall this afternoon at 1:00 p.m PT:\n\n\u23f0 Today, Saturday, February 15, 1:00 p.m PT\n\n\ud83d\udcde 855-962-0954\n\n\ud83d\udcbb https://t.co/a5qbfQ0vGI https://t.co/J2OGXIiEVh","created_at":"2025-02-15T17:19:09.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-15","when_et":"Feb 15, 2025, 12:19 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890813108714647931","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1489,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890504016393572612","text":"I'm mixing it up on this week's #RecapWithRick \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nHear directly from members of our community why the Republican Rip-Off is bad for #WA02. https://t.co/Xk8ptMX0Ip","created_at":"2025-02-14T20:50:56.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-14","when_et":"Feb 14, 2025, 3:50 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890504016393572612","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1375,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":2},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890502198934601899","text":"Excited to head down to Long Beach soon to see infrastructure projects in @RepRobertGarcia's district! https://t.co/l8R8Jybnq6","created_at":"2025-02-14T20:43:42.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-14","when_et":"Feb 14, 2025, 3:43 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890502198934601899","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7452,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":11},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Transportation and Public Works","keywords":["infrastructure"]}]},{"id":"1889806415382163929","text":"The goal of the Republican budget is to provide tax cuts to the richest Americans &amp; largest corporations. \n\nThe GOP is not serious about lowering costs for working families &amp; small businesses, growing the economy or reducing the deficit. https://t.co/lOM13DjDI7","created_at":"2025-02-12T22:38:54.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-12","when_et":"Feb 12, 2025, 5:38 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1889806415382163929","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":988,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":true,"topics":[{"topic":"Economics and Public Finance","keywords":["budget","deficit"]},{"topic":"Taxation","keywords":["tax cuts"]},{"topic":"Families","keywords":["families"]}]},{"id":"1889439418139971730","text":"Join me for a telephone town hall this Saturday, February 15th at 1:00 p.m. PT! \n\nDetails: https://t.co/dDLozOMMgC","created_at":"2025-02-11T22:20:36.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-11","when_et":"Feb 11, 2025, 5:20 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1889439418139971730","metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":18449,"like_count":11,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":147,"retweet_count":4},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1889089438786961549","text":"ICYMI \u27a1\ufe0f It was a busy first week of February on Capitol Hill. Hear how I'm fighting back on this week's #RecapWithRick \u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/vOqy6RzFdZ","created_at":"2025-02-10T23:09:54.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-10","when_et":"Feb 10, 2025, 6:09 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1889089438786961549","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":897,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":2},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1888734931251060774","text":"Go @Seahawks.\n\n#SBLIX https://t.co/wYamvuGtXt","created_at":"2025-02-09T23:41:13.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-09","when_et":"Feb 9, 2025, 6:41 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1888734931251060774","metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1200,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":true,"topics":[]},{"id":"1888329045970182313","text":"From @kencen President Deborah Rutter: https://t.co/FB24NXQ5Yh","created_at":"2025-02-08T20:48:22.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-08","when_et":"Feb 8, 2025, 3:48 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1888329045970182313","metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1107,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1888305634388681188","text":"As someone who appreciates the arts &amp; their role in telling U.S. history in all its glory &amp; pain, the President\u2019s actions are concerning at the least. The law does not allow him to appoint himself chair of the board. I am not even certain he knows what the chair of the board https://t.co/Zef3juMwGV","created_at":"2025-02-08T19:15:20.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-08","when_et":"Feb 8, 2025, 2:15 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1888305634388681188","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2600,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":true,"topics":[]},{"id":"1887982393945973227","text":"I am concerned that @EPA is failing to honor signed grant agreements allowing ports in WA, including the Port of #Anacortes &amp; @PortBellingham, to make long-term investments in shore power while promoting good-paying jobs that are essential to the country\u2019s maritime industry. https://t.co/H8x94oHM4A","created_at":"2025-02-07T21:50:54.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-07","when_et":"Feb 7, 2025, 4:50 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1887982393945973227","metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":946,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Environmental Protection","keywords":["epa"]},{"topic":"Labor and Employment","keywords":["jobs"]}]},{"id":"1887954879349449141","text":"https://t.co/3cMjTyee3M","created_at":"2025-02-07T20:01:34.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-07","when_et":"Feb 7, 2025, 3:01 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1887954879349449141","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":582,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1887597174030279150","text":"House Democrats are introducing the Taxpayer Data Protection Act to protect Americans\u2019 sensitive information &amp; essential benefits like Social Security &amp; Medicare from unelected &amp; unvetted billionaires. \n\nIf just three House Republicans side with the American people instead of https://t.co/jHJgF0RqOp","created_at":"2025-02-06T20:20:10.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-06","when_et":"Feb 6, 2025, 3:20 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1887597174030279150","metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5160,"like_count":64,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":21},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Health","keywords":["medicare"]},{"topic":"Social Welfare","keywords":["social security"]}]},{"id":"1887557034196730157","text":"Thank you to everyone who has called in, written in and rallied against Musk\u2019s illegal takeover of the Treasury. Your voice are needed to fight back \u2013 and it\u2019s working.\n\nAmerica has already won several rounds of the Republican Rip-Off. But we need to keep up the pressure. https://t.co/phm7awSrE4","created_at":"2025-02-06T17:40:40.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-06","when_et":"Feb 6, 2025, 12:40 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1887557034196730157","metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1238,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":3},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1887282688177914278","text":"On Saturday, I read to a group of young kids &amp; their parents at Mariner Public Library in Everett during Mariner Future Fest. \n\nToday, I received a great note from one of the young kids:\n\n\"Dear Rep. Larsen,  \n\n\"Thank you for reading to me this weekend.\n\n\"I want to ask you to help","created_at":"2025-02-05T23:30:31.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-05","when_et":"Feb 5, 2025, 6:30 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1887282688177914278","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":642,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1887216155095413109","text":"Stop the Musk Takeover. https://t.co/O7EuSjkQYY","created_at":"2025-02-05T19:06:08.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-05","when_et":"Feb 5, 2025, 2:06 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1887216155095413109","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":731,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":3},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1886560067664662745","text":"I\u2019ve heard from many of my constituents  who are fed up w/the Republican Rip-Off. This Admin is doing nothing to lower costs &amp; create jobs for my constituents \u2013 they're only sewing confusion &amp; chaos. Join me in fighting back against the Republican Rip-Off.","created_at":"2025-02-03T23:39:05.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-03","when_et":"Feb 3, 2025, 6:39 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1886560067664662745","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":520,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":true,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Labor and Employment","keywords":["jobs"]}]},{"id":"1886560065982701622","text":"It's Round Two of the Republican Rip-Off! This time, Trump is empowering an unelected billionaire w/many conflicts of interest to put my constituents\u2019 Social Security &amp; Medicare benefits &amp; data at risk &amp; interfere with USAID, undermining natl security &amp; U.S. global leadership.","created_at":"2025-02-03T23:39:04.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-03","when_et":"Feb 3, 2025, 6:39 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1886560065982701622","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2440,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":7},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Health","keywords":["medicare"]},{"topic":"Social Welfare","keywords":["social security"]}]},{"id":"1886106929740554461","text":"It was great to see so many folks celebrating the beginning of the Year of the Snake at the fourth annual #Edmonds Lunar New Year Market! I wish you all a happy, healthy and prosperous New Year! \ud83e\udde7 \ud83c\udf89 \ud83d\udc0d https://t.co/YvJpgb9GUd","created_at":"2025-02-02T17:38:28.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-02","when_et":"Feb 2, 2025, 12:38 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1886106929740554461","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":618,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1885905617577030027","text":"I won\u2019t stand for it. Join me in standing with working families to push back against the Republican Rip-Off.","created_at":"2025-02-02T04:18:32.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-01","when_et":"Feb 1, 2025, 11:18 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1885905617577030027","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":588,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":true,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Families","keywords":["families"]}]},{"id":"1885905615899287782","text":"Knowing there are so many good &amp; effective ways to stop fentanyl, I guess the Trump tariff &amp; tax increase is part of its scheme to find $ to pay for the GOP Rip-Off - a tax cut for the richest Americans &amp; wealthiest corporations paid for by everyday Americans &amp; small businesses.","created_at":"2025-02-02T04:18:31.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-01","when_et":"Feb 1, 2025, 11:18 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1885905615899287782","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":632,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":true,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Crime and Law Enforcement","keywords":["fentanyl"]},{"topic":"Taxation","keywords":["tariff","tax","tax cut"]}]},{"id":"1885905614213140850","text":"The Adminstration is better served by enhancing the existing international cooperation w/our Canadian partners, helping local law enforcement hold accountable those bringing the dangerous drugs into our communities, &amp; supporting real treatment &amp; recovery efforts.","created_at":"2025-02-02T04:18:31.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-01","when_et":"Feb 1, 2025, 11:18 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1885905614213140850","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":159,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":true,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Crime and Law Enforcement","keywords":["law enforcement"]}]},{"id":"1885905612766155209","text":"The Trump tariff &amp; tax increase purports to force our Canadian partners to fight drug trafficking &amp; dangerous fentanyl imports. The reality is fentanyl labs in B.C. &amp; Canada are a relatively new phenomenon &amp; are not the source of a vast majority of the drugs in the U.S.","created_at":"2025-02-02T04:18:31.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-01","when_et":"Feb 1, 2025, 11:18 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1885905612766155209","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":182,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":true,"is_quote":false,"topics":[{"topic":"Crime and Law Enforcement","keywords":["fentanyl","trafficking"]},{"topic":"Taxation","keywords":["tariff","tax"]},{"topic":"Foreign Trade and International Finance","keywords":["imports"]}]}],"recent":[{"id":"1891924212794691888","text":"\ud83c\udf99TUNE IN: I will be on Soundside with Libby Denkmann on @KUOW (94.9 FM) at 12pm and 8pm PT today to discuss my work fighting back against the Republican Rip-Off.","created_at":"2025-02-18T18:54:17.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-18","when_et":"Feb 18, 2025, 1:54 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1891924212794691888","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5194,"like_count":9,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":88,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890904332498825723","text":"Thx to the thousands of folks from across #WA02 who tuned in to my telephone town hall this afternoon!\n\nI was able to get to 18 of your questions, but if you have a question that didn\u2019t get answered, contact my office at Rick.Larsen@mail.house.gov or at https://t.co/1IH7WJ84vg. https://t.co/v7uBIoN5La https://t.co/wdlLt72RfG","created_at":"2025-02-15T23:21:38.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-15","when_et":"Feb 15, 2025, 6:21 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890904332498825723","metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":49883,"like_count":16,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":62,"retweet_count":0},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":true,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890877811369320466","text":"Thank you to everyone who has asked a question during my telephone town hall so far!\n\n\ud83d\udcde 855-962-0954\n\ud83d\udcbb https://t.co/a5qbfQ0vGI https://t.co/oLw3gytLpU","created_at":"2025-02-15T21:36:15.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-15","when_et":"Feb 15, 2025, 4:36 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890877811369320466","metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2307,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":3},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890813108714647931","text":"Join me for a telephone town hall this afternoon at 1:00 p.m PT:\n\n\u23f0 Today, Saturday, February 15, 1:00 p.m PT\n\n\ud83d\udcde 855-962-0954\n\n\ud83d\udcbb https://t.co/a5qbfQ0vGI https://t.co/J2OGXIiEVh","created_at":"2025-02-15T17:19:09.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-15","when_et":"Feb 15, 2025, 12:19 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/1890813108714647931","metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1489,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":1},"is_reply":false,"is_quote":false,"topics":[]},{"id":"1890504016393572612","text":"I'm mixing it up on this week's #RecapWithRick \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nHear directly from members of our community why the Republican Rip-Off is bad for #WA02. https://t.co/Xk8ptMX0Ip","created_at":"2025-02-14T20:50:56.000Z","date_et":"2025-02-14","when_et":"Feb 14, 2025, 3:50 PM EST","url":"https://x.com/RepRickLarsen/status/18905